{"id":"a668d880013388bd","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-canonical-convergence.md","title":"Convergence of the Canonical Frame","display":"thm-canonical-convergence — Convergence of the Canonical Frame","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-canonical-convergence","aliases":["89-thm-canonical-convergence"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-canonical-convergence — Convergence of the Canonical Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","[[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]]","[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-canonical-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-canonical-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-convergence — Convergence of the Canonical Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e81fa800505e986\" href=\"?note=3e81fa800505e986\" title=\"89-df-convergent-frame\">89-df-convergent-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f530ad4c65761317\" href=\"?note=f530ad4c65761317\" title=\"89-lem-canonical-relation-powers\">89-lem-canonical-relation-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"646a96fe655f6d74\" href=\"?note=646a96fe655f6d74\" title=\"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal\">89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92c4449a6fa3b997\" href=\"?note=92c4449a6fa3b997\" title=\"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties\">89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_L=(W_L,R_L)\">\\(F_L=(W_L,R_L)\\)</span> 为典范框架。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，并假设每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A)\\in L\">\\((\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A)\\in L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}\\)</span> 为四索引收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F_L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F_L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 89；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega R_L^i\\Gamma\">\\(\\Omega R_L^i\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega R_L^j\\Delta\">\\(\\Omega R_L^j\\Delta\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\{A:\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{B:\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta\\}\">\\(Z=\\{A:\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{B:\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta\\}\\)</span>。若不一致，有限见证合取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to\\neg B)\\in L\">\\((A\\to\\neg B)\\in L\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta\">\\(\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta\\)</span>。典范路径引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\in\\Omega\\)</span>；收敛模式再给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Delta\">\\(\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Delta\\)</span>。而正常性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Diamond^n A\\to\\neg\\Box^n B)\\in L\">\\((\\Diamond^n A\\to\\neg\\Box^n B)\\in L\\)</span>，矛盾。有限合取允许空列表。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 一致，可扩张为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span>；路径引理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma R_L^m\\Theta\">\\(\\Gamma R_L^m\\Theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta R_L^n\\Theta\">\\(\\Delta R_L^n\\Theta\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-convergent-frame","status":"resolved","id":"3e81fa800505e986","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-canonical-relation-powers","status":"resolved","id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","status":"resolved","id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","status":"resolved","id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"F_L=(W_L,R_L)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F_L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega R_L^i\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega R_L^j\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\{A:\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{B:\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\to\\neg B)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^m A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n B\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^n A\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Diamond^n A\\to\\neg\\Box^n B)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma R_L^m\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta R_L^n\\Theta","display":false}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c0f02193bdf6c63","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"852a0356bca26d3a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"收敛：[[89-df-modal-iteration]] → [[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]] → [[89-df-convergent-frame]] → [[89-thm-canonical-convergence]] → [[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]。边界：[[89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive]]、[[89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e81fa800505e986","f530ad4c65761317","646a96fe655f6d74","7c0e4d58dc068222","92c4449a6fa3b997"]}